[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13741.11, "timestamp": "03:49:01", "text": "它们已获得官方许可。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13745.11, "timestamp": "03:49:05", "text": "公司 e 的 IP 即使如此，那又是什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13747.58, "timestamp": "03:49:07", "text": "如果他们购买，那么他们购买的意义何在？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13748.67, "timestamp": "03:49:08", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13751.189, "timestamp": "03:49:11", "text": "离开的时候就像你说你去了，你完成了它的首秀"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13754.71, "timestamp": "03:49:14", "text": "你瞬间就造成了一件大事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13757.91, "timestamp": "03:49:17", "text": "重大问题，你会被解雇，或者你会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13760.07, "timestamp": "03:49:20", "text": "被告知要么毕业，要么被支配"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13764.71, "timestamp": "03:49:24", "text": "是的，一年之内，呃，beta版你做到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13767.75, "timestamp": "03:49:27", "text": "你因为一些蠢事被解雇了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13769.75, "timestamp": "03:49:29", "text": "或者那样的话，你就得为此付费。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13772.63, "timestamp": "03:49:32", "text": "损害、声誉和"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13775.023, "timestamp": "03:49:35", "author": "@S4bOTh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dwyGFV5nV4j6B4rbXTQnxbALJAtFrkvLLYXpy4kpbik67Arf3Y7OK8dSERSwTEtgKPyQeDTq-w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ooof"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13775.11, "timestamp": "03:49:35", "text": "你知道，这是给公司准备的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13777.91, "timestamp": "03:49:37", "text": "运作方式是这样的：你不能拥有它们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13780.11, "timestamp": "03:49:40", "text": "你不能拥有这家公司"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13784.07, "timestamp": "03:49:44", "text": "如果你表现不佳，资产就会受到影响，呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13786.63, "timestamp": "03:49:46", "text": "呃，你把事情搞砸了，你得赔偿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13790.55, "timestamp": "03:49:50", "text": "就损害赔偿而言，这是合法的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13793.349, "timestamp": "03:49:53", "text": "我想事情就是这样运作的。没有把握"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13797.229, "timestamp": "03:49:57", "text": "虽然我觉得就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13799.59, "timestamp": "03:49:59", "text": "作品。不过，事情真的太多了。"}]